WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.025
Check yourself with two questions.

2
00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:06.525
First: a compliance policy's only
assignment is an exclusion group.

3
00:00:06.525 --> 00:00:07.825
Which check reports it?

4
00:00:07.825 --> 00:00:10.450
The answer is b, compliance coverage.

5
00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:13.513
A policy with only exclusions
reaches no device,

6
00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:17.112
and by default an unassigned
device counts as compliant.

7
00:00:17.112 --> 00:00:19.901
Second: which of these is beta-only today?

8
00:00:19.901 --> 00:00:22.219
The answer is c: reading an Autopilot

9
00:00:22.219 --> 00:00:25.775
registration's deployment
profile assignment status.

10
00:00:25.775 --> 00:00:29.276
The profile assignment status,
the profiles themselves,

11
00:00:29.276 --> 00:00:33.150
the Settings Catalog and assignment
filters are all beta-only.

12
00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:38.020
The module page has two more questions,
each linked to the unit that answers it.
